      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling of needing control when everything else is collapsing is a very powerful and understandable impulse. However, choosing to end your life is not a dignified way to handle failure; it is a permanent end to a temporary crisis. There are ways to regain control, even when it feels impossible right now, and those ways involve staying present. Please, make the call to a crisis line; they can help you find a way through this immediate, unbearable moment.",
